OL,3,AMeghan to co-host Junior MasterChef
OL,4,AAustralia
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duchess of Sussex has been
OL,7,Fconfirmed as a co-host of the new
OL,8,Fseason of Junior MasterChef Australia.
OL,10,FMeghan will join the 2027 series as a
OL,11,F"special guest" with fellow host Poh
OL,12,FLing Yeow, according to Australia's
OL,13,FChannel 10.
OL,15,FThe duchess said she "can't wait" to
OL,16,Ftake part in the programme after an
OL,17,Fappearance as a guest judge on
OL,18,FMasterChef Australia last year. It was
OL,19,Fthe show's largest Sunday audience
OL,20,Fsince 2023, according to the statement
OL,21,Ffrom Paramount ANZ.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
